WEBVTT

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:12.500
<v Grace Liu>Morning, everyone. Monday the third of August. Can you all hear me before I spend five minutes talking to myself?</v>

00:00:14.619 --> 00:00:20.570
<v David Whitfield>Yeah, loud and clear. Sorry I'm a bit flustered, traffic on the ring road was absolutely solid.</v>

00:00:21.379 --> 00:00:25.230
<v Callum Reid>You and half the early shift. Lovely start to a Monday.</v>

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:31.600
<v David Whitfield>And the football last night didn't exactly improve my mood. What was that second half about?</v>

