<v Hannah Price>I knew we'd get to the football before anything mechanical.</v>

00:00:39.399 --> 00:00:43.250
<v David Whitfield>Well, plenty of things failing to function in both, wasn't there?</v>

00:00:44.630 --> 00:00:48.130
<v Grace Liu>Right, expert analysis over. Let's get through the factory bits.</v>

00:00:48.990 --> 00:00:53.189
<v Priya Raman>Um, am I coming through? Teams has picked the wrong microphone again.</v>

00:00:54.329 --> 00:00:57.829
<v Aisha Begum>You're fine now. Bit distant, but we can hear you.</v>

