00:02:53.310 --> 00:02:57.159
<v Sarah Okafor>Yeah, CT1. I'll do the filter swap by 11am, normal priority.</v>

00:02:59.110 --> 00:03:00.860
<v Grace Liu>Cheers, Sarah. That's with you.</v>

