00:04:31.319 --> 00:04:36.569
<v Callum Reid>Yeah, I'll do the site visit at Tollgate with the contractor. Happy to take that.</v>

00:04:36.970 --> 00:04:40.470
<v Aisha Begum>With the contractor there, rather than a separate look round?</v>

00:04:42.529 --> 00:04:45.680
<v Callum Reid>Yeah, with the contractor. Tollgate visit, normal priority, understood.</v>

00:04:46.990 --> 00:04:48.189
<v Grace Liu>Lovely, thanks.</v>

00:04:49.300 --> 00:04:53.149
<v Grace Liu>David Whitfield, can you send the shift handover report round today?</v>

00:04:55.589 --> 00:04:59.790
<v David Whitfield>Full name, blimey. Yeah, I'll send the shift handover report round today.</v>

00:05:00.860 --> 00:05:04.360
