00:05:44.430 --> 00:05:49.329
<v David Whitfield>Yeah, separate item. Mine's booking a contractor to look at the GT2 water valve.</v>

00:05:49.689 --> 00:05:51.439
<v Hannah Price>Fine, that distinction makes sense.</v>

00:05:52.250 --> 00:05:59.250
<v Grace Liu>Right, that's the agreed work. Finished items stay closed, deliveries still blocked, and the dryer shutdown is cancelled. Thanks, everyone.</v>

00:06:01.389 --> 00:06:06.290
<v Aisha Begum>Cheers. Nice to have one of these where Teams only ate half a sentence.</v>

00:06:06.860 --> 00:06:08.610
<v Callum Reid>Don't tempt it. Cheers, all.</v>
